# Build toolchain: the setuptools/wheel backend from pyproject.toml's
# [build-system], plus the `build` frontend. CI and release builds run with
# --no-isolation / --no-build-isolation, so the backend that builds every
# artifact (including the published sdist and wheel) is this hash-locked one,
# never a fresh unhashed download into an isolated build environment.
